{"id":140032407,"slug":"planetary-intergalactic","title":"Planetary, Intergalactic.","subtitle":"Owen Muir, M.D. Joins Michael Mann for a podcast extravaganza!","post_date":"2023-12-24T03:25:08.454Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/planetary-intergalactic","wordcount":176,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:55:27.585Z","body_sha256":"2d7bcd9b5288193c620edd19f14637a9f9ce526b9bdb8bb1fdb190019483d1a1","text_words":157,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>It is fitting— for a newsletter that was born as a <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiZ1sXjjqeDAxVhrYkEHRsvAwcQFnoECBAQAQ&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.webnewswire.com%2F2021%2F06%2F05%2Fclubhouses-creator-first-inaugural-class-includes-two-expert-psychiatrists%2F&amp;usg=AOvVaw2MYx2gij3zUUtxVMdmjwX_&amp;opi=89978449\">clubhouse</a> room— that I recently joined <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Michael Mann&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:82565550,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ed4f8cc0-cec8-46b1-8384-e31efcfbd6aa_1170x1558.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;eef1c0de-75e6-46b3-8834-e6df8c8189ff&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> as a guest on his substack (and podcast because, as <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mills Baker&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:11256580,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e2a259fa-fb64-4c34-ad97-3380dc40ce82_1171x1172.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c38e9af2-b77b-4b52-b69f-89e78cae286c&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> has informed me, <em>substack is now also for podcasts</em>): </p><p><span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Planetary Health First Mars Next, a Michael Mann production&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:1608255,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;pub&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/planetaryhealthfirstmarsnext&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/791e90fb-6f76-4080-a6e7-f5ddc484e287_500x500.png&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8d8af157-8a7b-4dc5-aa58-3301eae5fed3&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span></p><iframe class=\"spotify-wrap podcast\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;image&quot;:&quot;https://i.scdn.co/image/ab6765630000ba8a01f0f9e954bb8559f34f836f&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;#40 Dr. Owen Muir, all things Mental Health, psychiatry, the universe, &amp; music&quot;,&quot;subtitle&quot;:&quot;Planetary Health First Mars Next, a Michael Mann production &quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Episode&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.spotify.com/episode/1CfFC3000BFJgG9CETBaRW&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;noScroll&quot;:false}\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/episode/1CfFC3000BFJgG9CETBaRW\" frameborder=\"0\" gesture=\"media\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allow=\"encrypted-media\" data-component-name=\"Spotify2ToDOM\"></iframe><p>We discuss: <a href=\"https://www.fermata.health/clinical-trials\">SAINT neuromodulation</a>!  (shocker, I know).  We dive into other favorite topics like the <a href=\"https://www.irxreminder.com/news/article/phase-ii-nih-grant-awarded/649/\">TDetect Program</a> at <a href=\"https://www.irxreminder.com/company/\">iRxReminder</a>, and the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/the-future-of-brain-health?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">removal of the word “mental”</a> from the front of the word “health,” <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/world-mental-health-day?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">which I consider good enough.</a></p><p>Thanks for listening!   I love a good “collab”—just ask <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Awais Aftab&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:18723016,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F595b3363-046e-4623-887b-84b0fabfe8e6_2499x2499.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b4d55864-4210-4e9a-bf16-917dc8ad27f0&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Leon Macfayden&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:58738258,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6c70f430-a31c-4c10-8271-bdfebdae31a3_708x493.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d9f2e747-1b8c-4952-a6ce-715dcc8d33f9&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;@Psych Fox&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:15519985,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/59d1c6de-6415-4efe-8930-dee3aacb686a_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;814c99ea-93e2-4f8d-9566-e1819d0e88e9&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Carlene MacMillan, MD&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:20179948,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/62e4f131-0d58-4d2b-965c-4f226291bcd6_720x720.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;43fd6532-23f0-4508-a2d5-6e9551b77e2d&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> , <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Sanjay Shirke&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:1677383,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F73e5bdb9-034f-4079-a762-71bb9724bea7_144x144.png&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;44ed1469-7c0b-47cc-b304-9fa54951b20b&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span>, <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alex Mendelsohn&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:154828735,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa8501153-4567-4c9a-aa8e-8f63e2061035_1024x1024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c4883973-74b0-47f0-8c49-ee640521c4af&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> , to name just a few from the past year!</p><p>If you enjou these topics, and will be in the San Fransisco Area on January 7th, please join us for Rapid Acting Mental Health Treatment, 2024!  <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/rapid-acting-mental-health-treatment-2024-tickets-745564622857?aff=oddtdtcreator\">Tickets for this live event are available here!</a></p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">The Frontier Psychiatrists  is a reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, consider becoming a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p></p><p></p>","text":"It is fitting— for a newsletter that was born as a clubhouse room— that I recently joined as a guest on his substack (and podcast because, as has informed me, substack is now also for podcasts ):\n\nWe discuss: SAINT neuromodulation ! (shocker, I know). We dive into other favorite topics like the TDetect Program at iRxReminder , and the removal of the word “mental” from the front of the word “health,” which I consider good enough.\n\nThanks for listening! I love a good “collab”—just ask , , , , , , to name just a few from the past year!\n\nIf you enjou these topics, and will be in the San Fransisco Area on January 7th, please join us for Rapid Acting Mental Health Treatment, 2024! Tickets for this live event are available here!\n\nThe Frontier Psychiatrists is a reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, consider becoming a free or paid subscriber."}